平台筛选建联实操 - 蝉圈圈-达播学习圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1398.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1398.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-74f7987d670c4272a8a1f5f6e116afdc:11","title":"电商运营如何找竞品合作达人-蝉妈妈AI抖音数据分析工具","raw_url":"https://ai.chanmama.com/article/727","normalized_url":"https://ai.chanmama.com/article/727","host":"ai.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-74f7987d670c4272a8a1f5f6e116afdc:12","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-74f7987d670c4272a8a1f5f6e116afdc:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-74f7987d670c4272a8a1f5f6e116afdc:14","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-74f7987d670c4272a8a1f5f6e116afdc:15","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-74f7987d670c4272a8a1f5f6e116afdc:16","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-74f7987d670c4272a8a1f5f6e116afdc:17","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-74f7987d670c4272a8a1f5f6e116afdc:18","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-74f7987d670c4272a8a1f5f6e116afdc:19","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-74f7987d670c4272a8a1f5f6e116afdc:20","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-74f7987d670c4272a8a1f5f6e116afdc:21","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-74f7987d670c4272a8a1f5f6e116afdc:22","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-74f7987d670c4272a8a1f5f6e116afdc:23","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","question_text":"怎么找竞品合作过的达人？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":24,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":12,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"051be6072773598ca714580b7ec843bd5c82c103b642065c69eca89182636494","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 一、官方平台工具（优先，可信度最高）\n## ✅ 抖音（巨量星图）\n巨量星图达人广场 → **商单经验**，直接填入竞品品牌，可以筛选**近30/90天给这个品牌发过商单的达人**，还能看到达人报价、粉丝画像、内容数据。\n> 补充：抖店后台【精选联盟】→【找合作】→**同行合作参考**，输入竞品店铺，直接拉出帮竞品带货的达人、销量、场次，适合带货类达人挖掘。\n\n## ✅ 小红书（蒲公英平台）\n蒲公英达人广场，筛选**合作品牌**，输入竞品名称，筛选近段时间报备合作达人；\n也可以搜竞品品牌名，筛选笔记，看哪些博主带品牌标签、品牌@、产品植入。\n\n# 二、第三方数据工具（批量扒清单，最常用）\n- 抖音：飞瓜、新抖、蝉妈妈、灰豚。输入竞品品牌/商品链接，一键导出**所有发布过该品牌视频的达人**，按GMV、播放、互动排序，优先抓多次复投、带货效果好的达人\n- 小红书：新红、千瓜。搜竞品品牌，看品牌笔记，统计所有@品牌、带产品的博主，区分报备商单/自发种草\n- 视频号：新视、灰豚数据\n\n> 小技巧：同时导入3~5个竞品，找**多个竞品都重复合作的达人**，这类是赛道成熟、转化稳定的核心达人，优先建联。\n\n# 三、手动免费人肉查找（不用付费工具，适合小预算）\n1. **搜索品牌关键词**：平台搜索竞品品牌名，筛选【视频/笔记】，时间选近3个月，逐个点开，记录博主账号；看文案有没有“品牌合作/广告/置换”标注\n2. **竞品官方账号主页**：看品牌置顶、合作合集、被@/被标记的博主，很多品牌会转发达人种草内容\n3. **商品详情页达人秀**：抖音商品链接点进去，达人秀板块，所有挂车带货该产品的达人全部展示\n4. **评论区+相关推荐**：爆款竞品笔记下面经常有达人的合作内容推荐，顺藤摸瓜挖同类型博主\n\n# 四、筛选达人，清洗名单（重点，不要拿到名单就直接发）\n拿到名单后，做3层过滤：\n1. **真实性**：区分「付费商单达人」vs「自发素人种草」，素人一般很难直接商务合作\n2. **效果指标**：优先看：互动率、粉丝画像是否匹配你的客群、历史同品类内容转化；不要只看粉丝数\n3. **合作冲突**：看达人近期是否还在持续强推竞品，部分达人有排他，需要提前沟通\n\n# 五、建联小提示\n达人接过竞品，**不等于不能合作**，很多达人可以同时接同类品牌，你重点准备差异化卖点、佣金/报价方案；\n联系时带上证据：“看到你之前和XX品牌合作的那条笔记效果很好，我们同赛道，产品差异化XXX”，通过率更高。\n\n# 六、简易SOP总结\n1. 选定3-5个核心竞品\n2. 星图/蒲公英查官方商单清单 + 第三方工具批量导出\n3. 人工复核，剔除素人、低互动、粉丝画像不符账号\n4. 标记：头部/腰部/尾部、是否多次给竞品投放、内容形式（短视频/直播/图文）\n5. 整理成达人表，排期建联\n\n\n\n你主要是做**抖音还是小红书**？我可以给你对应平台直接复制的筛选关键词和达人信息表模板。","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-4388194b48ba4a0b91ad2c6f99bd32aa:1","title":"How to Find the Influencers Your Competitors Work With | The Hive Blog","raw_url":"https://blog.hiveinfluence.io/find-your-competitors-influencers/","normalized_url":"https://blog.hiveinfluence.io/find-your-competitors-influencers/","host":"blog.hiveinfluence.io","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-4388194b48ba4a0b91ad2c6f99bd32aa:2","title":"短视频-达人广场筛选功能介绍-星图营销服务平台","raw_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/114908","normalized_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/114908","host":"www.xingtu.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-4388194b48ba4a0b91ad2c6f99bd32aa:3","title":"商家找达人带货，如何快速找到精准达人？@飞瓜智星 ｜达人分销 #达人分销#商务BD#找达人带货","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7582152473461689615","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7582152473461689615","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-4388194b48ba4a0b91ad2c6f99bd32aa:4","title":"1分钟教你快速找到竞品带货达人 #tiktok #达人带货 #达人营销 #跨境电商 #电商干货","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7663457334596865314","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7663457334596865314","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0143","question_id":"CQ-Q0143","citation_id":"smp-4388194b48ba4a0b91ad2c6f99bd32aa:5","title":"怎么快速找到竞品挂车达人 #达人邀约 #达人合作 #达人建联 #达人分销 #小青苔达人","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7679779678182295717","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7679779678182295717","host":"www.